ions hold you back.  Iron Will is for everyone who wants to feel stronger, healthier, and more confident.\\n\\n**(Close-up shot of the woman lifting weights. Her eyes sparkle with confidence.)**\\n\\n**Woman:**  Iron Will gave me the strength to conquer my challenges, both inside and outside the gym.  \\n\\n**(The camera zooms out to show the entire group lifting weights together, their faces full of joy and accomplishment.)**\\n\\n**Narrator:**  Join Iron Will.  Discover your inner strength.  \\n\\n**(Superimposed text: Iron Will Weightlifting Class.  Contact us today.)**\\n\\n**(The screen fades to black as inspiring music continues to play.)** \\n\",\n        \"model\": \"Gemini AI\"\n    },\n    {\n        \"timestamp\": \"20240704151910\",\n        \"product\": \"a golf club\",\n        \"prompt\": \"Write a script for an advert promoting a golf club\",\n        \"response\": \"##  The Perfect Shot - A Golf Club Advert\\n\\n**Scene:** A montage of beautiful shots showcasing the golf course. Green hills, sparkling lakes, and pristine greens. The sun shines, birds sing, and golfers of all ages enjoy the game.\\n\\n**Voiceover (Warm, inviting):**  Looking for a place where the only thing you need to worry about is your next shot? A place where the stress melts away and your game flourishes? \\n\\n**(Camera zooms in on a golfer sinking a putt. He smiles, raises his fist in victory.)**\\n\\n**Voiceover:** Introducing [Golf Club Name], your sanctuary for the ultimate golfing experience.\\n\\n**(Quick cuts show various aspects of the club: well-maintained course, clubhouse with warm atmosphere, friendly staff, and relaxed golfers enjoying drinks and socializing.)**\\n\\n**Voiceover:** Our meticulously groomed course offers challenges for every skill level, with breathtaking views at every turn. \\n\\n**(Camera focuses on a golfer teeing off, a proud look on his face. He drives the ball long and straight.)**\\n\\n**Voiceover:**  From our state-of-the-art driving range 